  "additive_wt": 0.0
}
```

**Rationale:** This is an independent validation repeat of the single-run candidate `18-0add-15deg-cosolv-none-bathSolv-none-0wt-300s-NoN2-1800s` (Oct 31), which yielded Elastic Modulus = 488 bar and Pore Fraction = 0.35 with a clean, defect-free membrane and low CV (0.02). This point sits in the middle of the observed Pareto front — better pore fraction than the high-modulus cluster (~0.27–0.31) and better modulus than the high-pore-fraction cluster (~350–470 bar at PF 0.38–0.44). With only one synthesis, reproducibility is unknown. A confirmed repeat at these same parameters will establish whether this balanced performance is reliable, and if so, it becomes a validated Pareto-front point that justifies further exploration in the 18 wt% / 15°C bath / no-N2 / moderate-wait region.

